WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,080
Why does this car look familiar?

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,960
Is your child saying hello to you?

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,520
Why are you so cold?

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:10,120
Xiao Li

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,400
I was distracted just now

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,520
think of something

7
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:20,420
Xiao Li

8
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,940
Listen to what Wanwan said

9
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,620
Your company is just getting started

10
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,220
Just buy this car

11
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,540
The company will be in trouble

12
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,940
A gift from an elder at home

13
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,100
Gift from elders

14
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,180
Can I give you a three-row car like this?

15
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:33,780
The strength of this elder

16
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:36,300
Isn't it as common as my son guessed?

17
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,900
Could it be bringing a pool?

18
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:45,260
The father of the Guan family

19
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,580
You see my problem, we are chatting

20
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,140
Let’s talk about business

21
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,300
Today is a family dinner

22
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,860
Can't work, Xiao Li

23
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:54,940
That time at Zimingshan

24
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,500
Thank you for saving Wanwan

25
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,900
My uncle has set up a table at his house for later

26
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,220
Let's have a good drink
